### Aniimo UID Top-Up API — local test requests
### Use with VS Code REST Client or JetBrains HTTP Client.
@base = http://localhost:8000

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Verify a UID (mock provider → Sweettoast, Lv80, Server 4)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/aniimo/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uid": "412000126173",
  "server": "4"
}

### Verify — unknown UID (404 UID_NOT_FOUND)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/aniimo/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uid": "999999999",
  "server": "4"
}

### Verify — invalid UID format (422)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/aniimo/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uid": "abc",
  "server": "4"
}

### List packages (live upstream catalogue)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/aniimo/packages?server=4

### Create a UID-based order (MyCard)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/aniimo/order
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uid": "412000126173",
  "server": "4",
  "package_id": "290002",
  "quantity": 1
}


### Live session: use tools.run_session and base http://127.0.0.1:8002
### Only returns this connected account's role. No token belongs in this file.
POST http://127.0.0.1:8002/api/v1/aniimo/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{"uid":"412001104638","server":"4"}

### Invalid server format (422)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/aniimo/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{"uid":"412000126173","server":"abc"}

### Session: UID not in connected account (404 UID_NOT_IN_ACCOUNT)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8002/api/v1/aniimo/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{"uid":"999999999","server":"4"}
